  Ubuntu Light: Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0. See licenses/fonts/UFL-1.0-Ubuntu-font.txt.
  Hack Regular: MIT, with Bitstream Vera licence portions. See licenses/fonts/LICENSE-Hack.txt.
